Update history: 22-09-18 04:02

LICIACube Spacecraft Clock Kernel (SCLK)
===========================================

        This file is a SPICE spacecraft clock (SCLK) kernel containing
        information required for time conversions involving the on-board
        LICIACube spacecraft clock


Version
-------------------------------------------

        LICIA SCLK Kernel Version:

        LICIA Version 001 - February 2022 - Argotec LCC Team
                The initial LICIA SCLK kernel, with true spacecraft ID (-210),
                data formats and time references


Reference
-------------------------------------------

        As a reference for the creation and usage of this kernel,
        please refer to the "SCLK Required Reading" section of
        the documentation on JPL NAIF's website


